#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid "A handy resource monitor to report CPU load, memory usage, disk usage status and more."
msgstr "Удобный монитор ресурсов, который позволяет получать информацию о загрузке процессора, использовании памяти, состоянии использования диска и многом другом."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid "* NVDA 2026.3 or later is required.\n"
"* Fully transitioned to Resource Monitor layer commands set. As a result, NVDA+Shift+number row commands are removed (individual resource info commands can be assigned from input gestures dialog).\n"
"* Added a layer commands mode to let NVDA announce resource information and then immediately deactivate the layer. Pressing the layer entry command repeatedly will lock the layer mode as in previous add-on releases.\n"
"* Added layer entry setting to configure behavior of layer mode locking (default behavior is to lock the layer mode when layer entry command is pressed once)."
msgstr ""

